"""
Casino Royals Bot
==================

Single-file Telegram group casino with six transparent Telegram-animated games,
a one-time optional private play-group invite, optional news-channel link, SQLite
economy, Premium emoji messages/buttons, deposits, withdrawals, Bot API 9.4
button styles, and an administration panel.

Runtime requirements (auto-installed when missing):
    Python 3.9+
    python-telegram-bot==22.7
    Pillow>=10.0

Configuration is intentionally read from environment variables so credentials
are not committed to source code:
    TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN      optional secure override for the embedded deployment token
    BOT_DATABASE_PATH       optional; default: group_dice_royale.db
    BOT_ADMIN_IDS           optional comma-separated owner-ID override
    BOT_COMMISSION_ACCOUNT_ID optional owner account that receives every game commission
    PREMIUM_BUTTON_ICONS    optional; 1 by default, set 0 for plain-text buttons
    PREMIUM_MESSAGE_EMOJIS  optional; 1 by default, set 0 for ordinary message emoji
    BUTTON_EMOJI_<KEY>_ID   optional per-button Premium emoji override

The QR encoder embedded below is Project Nayuki's MIT-licensed QR Code
Generator. The PNG writer uses only Python's standard library, keeping this
application self-contained.
"""

